## 🎯 DISTRIBUTED LAYER INFERENCE - Phase 1 Progress Update (October 6, 2025)

### Commit 49d3868: Phase 1 Core Infrastructure 60% Complete ✅
**Type:** Major milestone - Core infrastructure implementation
**Status:** Successfully pushed to origin/main
