6. Create comprehensive tests

### ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                  Pipeline Coordinator                    │
│  (Orchestrates pipeline, routes requests, monitors)     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │
        ┌──────────────────┼──────────────────┐
        │                  │                  │
┌───────▼────────┐ ┌──────▼───────┐ ┌───────▼────────┐
│  Layer Worker  │ │ Layer Worker │ │  Layer Worker  │
│   (Layers 0-26)│ │ (Layers 27-53)│ │ (Layers 54-79) │
│                │ │               │ │                │
│ ModelPartitioner│ │ModelPartitioner│ │ModelPartitioner│
│ ActivationXfer │ │ ActivationXfer│ │ ActivationXfer │
└────────────────┘ └───────────────┘ └────────────────┘
```

**Data Flow:**
1. Request arrives at Pipeline Coordinator
2. Coordinator routes to first Layer Worker
3. Worker 1 processes layers 0-26, sends activations to Worker 2
4. Worker 2 processes layers 27-53, sends activations to Worker 3
5. Worker 3 processes layers 54-79, returns final output
6. Coordinator returns response to client

